 "remarks": "A magnificent Colonial estate offering an extraordinary blend of elegance, privacy and resort-style living on 2.45 beautifully manicured acres, adjoining 50 acres of conservation land. Grand in scale yet thoughtfully designed for today's lifestyle, the residence features 6 bedrooms, 6 full and 1 partial bath, including a sumptuous primary suite with two walk-in closets, dressing room, spa bath and private balcony overlooking the tranquil grounds. Five additional bedrooms offer en-suite baths, with two featuring walk-in closets. A dramatic two-story foyer introduces gracious formal living and dining rooms, two private offices and a handsome library. At the heart of the home, a newly renovated chef's kitchen features double marble islands, dual ovens and dishwashers, navy subway tile backsplash, wine fridge and custom coffee bar, flowing seamlessly into the inviting family room with fireplace. The spectacular great room is designed for memorable entertaining, with soaring ceilings, floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace, full bar with beverage refrigerator and direct access to the restored pool and spa, expansive deck, sport court and terrace. The finished lower level adds a gym, wine cellar and generous playroom with built-in bunk beds. A four-car garage and attached one-bedroom apartment provide exceptional convenience and flexibility for guests or multi-generational living. An exceptional private retreat in a coveted location near award-winning schools.",
